{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nevitsky Castle<strong>: The Bloody Legend of Transcarpathia</strong> is a hybrid 2.5D adventure platformer set in the early 17th century, in the heart of Transcarpathia. You play as Gustav Bertolucci, an Italian monster hunter sent by the Vatican on a secret mission. His goal is to investigate the dark events unfolding in Nevytsky Castle and save the local villagers from their new cruel mistress \u2014 Elizabeth B\u00e1thory. <br> <br>As you explore the castle and its surroundings, you\u2019ll uncover eerie locations, interact with NPCs, and battle nightmarish creatures in intense combat. The game combines the charm of pixel art with modern graphical features like 3D elements and dynamic lighting, creating a rich and atmospheric gameplay experience.<br><br>Test your strength against the legendary creatures of Carpathian folklore.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954220/extras/98631e49008e8f7c54768a1706118eea.poster.avif?t=1761809925\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954220/extras/98631e49008e8f7c54768a1706118eea.webm?t=1761809925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954220/extras/98631e49008e8f7c54768a1706118eea.mp4?t=1761809925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The game features three types of weapons: a sword, an axe, and a crossbow.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954220/extras/0ab996dfeebd40fa9ed809ddad3405a5.poster.avif?t=1761809925\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954220/extras/0ab996dfeebd40fa9ed809ddad3405a5.webm?t=1761809925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954220/extras/0ab996dfeebd40fa9ed809ddad3405a5.mp4?t=1761809925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3954220?t=1761809925","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954220/a485ba0b2498a98aa467b379884960e9dd9e6841/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761809925","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954220/bcbc50b0cd193051445022bab87b8606434ae708/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761809925","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954220/bcbc50b0cd193051445022bab87b8606434ae708/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761809925","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3954410,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nevitsky Castle<strong>: The Bloody Legend of Transcarpathia</strong> is a hybrid 2.5D adventure platformer set in the early 17th century, in the heart of Transcarpathia. You play as Gustav Bertolucci, an Italian monster hunter sent by the Vatican on a secret mission. His goal is to investigate the dark events unfolding in Nevytsky Castle and save the local villagers from their new cruel mistress \u2014 Elizabeth B\u00e1thory. <br> <br>As you explore the castle and its surroundings, you\u2019ll uncover eerie locations, interact with NPCs, and battle nightmarish creatures in intense combat. The game combines the charm of pixel art with modern graphical features like 3D elements and dynamic lighting, creating a rich and atmospheric gameplay experience